# The pipeline’s scratch files, its record of the photos this folder has had
# (seen.json), and in bucket mode the resized photos waiting for upload
# (.minimalgallery/cache/media). Everything else the pipeline writes, the
# manifests (.minimalgallery/manifest) and the resized photos (public/_mg),
# can be kept in git.
.minimalgallery/cache

# If you keep this gallery in git, the original photos stay out of it: a
# repository of full-size originals soon outgrows what GitHub and other git
# hosts accept, and a public repository would let anyone download them. The
# sidecars (.xmp) and each album’s _album.md are kept. To keep the originals
# in the repository too, delete these lines. Either way, back up the gallery
# folder itself: https://docs.minimalgallery.net/backups/
photos/**
!photos/**/
!photos/**/*.md
!photos/**/*.xmp
!photos/**/*.XMP
